        synopsis {place_design ?-concurrent_macros?}
        description {Placement only, without the optimisation that place_opt_design folds in. The legacy placeDesign (confirmed in Cadence's own release notes as placeDesign -noPrePlaceOpt) was split across these two common-UI commands.}
        source {Cadence release notes / RAK}
    }
}

