    hover {
        summary {Stream out a GDSII file (legacy UI).}
        synopsis {streamOut file_name ?-merge gds_files? ?-mapFile map?}
        description {The GDSII writer of the legacy (pre-common-UI) Innovus/Encounter command set, spelled as one camelCase word — there is no underscored stream_out. It belongs to the same legacy camelCase family as oasisOut, defIn/defOut, floorPlan, globalNetConnect, placeDesign, optDesign, verifyGeometry and saveDesign/restoreDesign. The common-UI GDSII writer is believed to be write_gds, but that pairing is not confirmed by Cadence-authored material.}
        source {Cadence release notes / RAK}
    }
}

